D&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;预缓冲 500 ms · 拖尾 1 s&lt;/span&gt;" link="device.html#s3" id="p02-n-g0"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="252" y="132" width="145" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;密钥销毁&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;zeroize_covered：回执、封口、启动时&lt;/span&gt;" link="design-device.html#dd-link" id="p02-n-zero"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="230" width="150" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;密钥表（NOR）&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;日志槽 · 每块一把 · 写 0 销毁&lt;/span&gt;" link="design-device.html#dd-link" id="p02-n-keytab"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="340" width="150" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;CMD 执行&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;pending → executing → completed&lt;/span&gt;" link="design-device.html#dd-link" id="p02-n-cmd"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="450" width="150" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;控制状态&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;acked 水位先落盘 · receiver_epoch&lt;/span&gt;" link="design-device.html#dd-link" id="p02-n-ctrl"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="560" width="150" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;启动恢复&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;封口遗留 WRITING → 补销毁 → 续 CMD&lt;/span&gt;" link="design-device.html#dd-link" id="p02-n-boot"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="670" width="150" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Opus 编码&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;16 kHz · 20 ms · 16 kb/s CBR&lt;/span&gt;" link="design-device.html#dd-link" id="p02-n-opus"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="235" y="230" width="160" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;NAND 块环&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;128 MiB · 约 16.5 h · 块密钥加密&lt;/span&gt;" link="design-device.html#dd-link" id="p02-n-flash"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="235" y="340" width="160" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;RTC · 序号 · 世代&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;32.768 kHz；写入每页页头&lt;/span&gt;" link="design-device.html#dd-link" id="p02-n-rtc"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="235" y="670" width="160" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;BLE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;L2CAP CoC&lt;br&gt;（GATT 回退）&lt;br&gt;2M PHY&lt;/span&gt;" link="design-device.html#dd-link" id="p02-n-ble"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="435" y="230" width="64" height="510" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;设备命令表&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;device_commands；cmd_seq 持久分配&lt;/span&gt;" link="design-device.html#dd-link" id="p02-n-cmdq"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600" y="230" width="125" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;BLE 接收&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;先落盘 fsync 再 ACK&lt;/span&gt;" link="design-device.html#dd-link" id="p02-n-rx"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600" y="340" width="125" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;单调 → UTC&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;MonoToUtc；跳变 &amp;gt;1 s 改用服务端&lt;/span&gt;" link="design-device.html#dd-timeline" id="p02-n-mono"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600" y="450" width="125" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;时钟校准&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;8 次取最短 RTT · 每 5 min&lt;/span&gt;" link="design-device.html#dd-timeline" id="p02-n-clock"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600" y="560" width="125" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;时间线拼接&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;主键 (device, gen, seq)；出 GAP&lt;/span&gt;" link="design-device.html#dd-timeline" id="p02-n-stitch"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="755" y="340" width="125" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;超期与背压&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;7 天硬删 · 2 GB 停发 ACK&lt;/span&gt;" link="design-device.html#dd-stage" id="p02-n-expire"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="755" y="560" width="125" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;钥匙串&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;raw_key · day_key 包裹 K&lt;/span&gt;" link="design-device.html#dd-stage" id="p02-n-key"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="910" y="230" width="125" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;原始帧文件&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;.raw；每页一条 AEAD&lt;/span&gt;" link="design-device.html#dd-stage" id="p02-n-raw"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="910" y="340" width="125" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;分片封口&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;15,000 帧 · full | sync | gen_end&lt;/span&gt;" link="design-device.html#dd-stage" id="p02-n-seal"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="910" y="450" width="125" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;L1 拒识&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;θ 0.1 · 扩边 500 ms · 合并 2 s&lt;/span&gt;" link="design-device.html#dd-l1" id="p02-n-l1"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1065" y="340" width="125" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;清单打包&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;§6.1 + enc · runs · l1 · clock&lt;/span&gt;" link="design-device.html#dd-stage" id="p02-n-manifest"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1065" y="450" width="125" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;缺口上报&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;phone_expired 等&lt;/span&gt;" link="design-device.html#dd-stage" id="p02-n-gaps"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1065" y="560" width="125" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;载荷生成&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;chained Ogg Opus · 后续包裁尾&lt;/span&gt;" link="design-device.html#dd-stage" id="p02-n-pay"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1220" y="340" width="125" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;批量上传&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;prepare → PUT → commit · ≤2 并发&lt;/span&gt;" link="design-device.html#dd-stage" id="p02-n-upload"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1220" y="450" width="125" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;调度条件&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;≥30 min · 最旧 &amp;gt;2 h · 立即同步&lt;/span&gt;" link="design-device.html#dd-stage" id="p02-n-sched"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1220" y="560" width="125" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;回执处理&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;receipt_acks 先落盘 · 先清理后发&lt;/span&gt;" link="design-device.html#dd-stage" id="p02-n-receipt"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1220" y="670" width="125" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;暂存库（SQLite）&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;chunks · anchors · gaps · clock samples / segments · device_commands · receipt_acks&lt;/span&gt;" link="design-device.html#dd-stage" id="p02-n-db"><mxCell style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=7;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=13;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600" y="780" width="745" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;短期音频桶&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;预签名直传 · 15 min 过期&lt;/span&gt;" link="platform.html#s5-12" id="p02-n-bucket"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1445" y="340" width="125" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;接入网关&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;prepare / commit；chunk_id 幂等&lt;/span&gt;" link="platform.html#s5-11" id="p02-n-gw"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1445" y="450" width="125" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;回执接口&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;GET /v1/receipts · ack-local&lt;/span&gt;" link="platform.html#s5-14" id="p02-n-rcpt"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1445" y="670" width="125" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><mxCell id="p02-_28" value="链路：突发 15–30 ms 间隔、2M PHY，目标 ≥25 KB/s，每 60 s 成批；空闲回长间隔 285–300 ms、外设延迟 4、监督超时 5 s。&lt;br&gt;ACK 每 2 s 或 64 页；从回执到密钥清零 P99 &amp;lt;5 s。领夹通电 7 天未回执则销毁并登记 device_expired。&lt;br&gt;校时：8 次取 RTT 最短，单样本 RTT ≤200 ms，误差目标 ≤200 ms。" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=10;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#c9b037;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="890" width="760" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p02-_29" value="暂存：7 天硬期限（从首次落盘起算）；2 GB 是背压，停发 ACK，不删未到期数据。&lt;br&gt;L1：最短丢弃 1 s，误丢单侧 95% 上界 ≤0.5%，电量 &amp;lt;20% 且未充电时 bypassed。&lt;br&gt;上传：蜂窝只用于立即同步或最旧 &amp;gt;4 h，此时取消 wifi 任务、改 any 重建；重试 30 s 起、上限 30 min。" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=10;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#c9b037;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="890" width="560" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p02-_30" value="连线" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#333333;spacing=4;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1380" y="890" width="200" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p02-_32" value="音频（敏感）" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#333333;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1458" y="909" width="120" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p02-_34" value="文字" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#333333;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1458" y="935" width="120" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p02-_36" value="控制 · 回执 · 擦除" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#333333;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1458" y="961" width="120" height=